            <description lang="en">TMC9660 register BRAKE_CHOPPER_VOLTAGE_LIMIT
If the brake chopper is enabled and supply voltage exceeds this value, the brake chopper output will be activated.
Min: 50; Max: 1000; Default: 260; Unit: 0.1V
  </description>
            <DINT />
            <q1:defaultValue value="260" />
            <q1:property name="CO_countLabel" value="TMC_PARAMS" />
            <q1:property name="CO_storageGroup" value="PERSIST_TMC" />
