            <description lang="en">TMC9660 register RELEASE_BRAKE
Release the external brake by applying a PWM signal.
Min: 0; Max: 1; Default: 0
Values:
  BRAKE_PWM_DEACTIVATED = 0
  BRAKE_PWM_ACTIVATED = 1
  </description>
            <DINT />
